      "No matter -- grasp thy sword and away!",
      "Let those, who brook the chain",
      "Of Saxon or of Dane,",
      "Ignobly by their fire-sides stay;",
      "One sigh to home be given,",
      "One heartfelt prayer to heaven,",
      "Then, for Erin and her cause, boy, hurra! hurra! hurra!",
