    "publication_date": "c. 1886",
    "original_collection": "Collected poetry archive",
    "publisher": "PoetryDB / collected poetry archive",
    "themes": [],
    "text": [
      "Each Life Converges to some Centre --",
      "Expressed -- or still --",
      "Exists in every Human Nature",
      "A Goal --",
      "Embodied scarcely to itself -- it may be --",
      "Too fair",
      "For Credibility's presumption",
      "To mar --",
      "Adored with caution -- as a Brittle Heaven --",
      "To reach",
      "Were hopeless, as the Rainbow's Raiment",
      "To touch --",
      "Yet persevered toward -- sure -- for the Distance --",
      "How high --",
      "Unto the Saint's slow diligence --",
      "The Sky --",
      "Ungained -- it may be -- by a Life's low Venture --",
      "But then --",
      "Eternity enable the endeavoring",
      "Again."
    ],
    "fulltext": "Each Life Converges to some Centre --\nExpressed -- or still --\nExists in every Human Nature\nA Goal --\nEmbodied scarcely to itself -- it may be --\nToo fair\nFor Credibility's presumption\nTo mar --\nAdored with caution -- as a Brittle Heaven --\nTo reach\nWere hopeless, as the Rainbow's Raiment\nTo touch --\nYet persevered toward -- sure -- for the Distance --\nHow high --\nUnto the Saint's slow diligence --\nThe Sky --\nUngained -- it may be -- by a Life's low Venture --\nBut then --\nEternity enable the endeavoring\nAgain.",
    "original_text": "Each Life Converges to some Centre --\nExpressed -- or still --\nExists in every Human Nature\nA Goal --\nEmbodied scarcely to itself -- it may be --\nToo fair\nFor Credibility's presumption\nTo mar --\nAdored with caution -- as a Brittle Heaven --\nTo reach\nWere hopeless, as the Rainbow's Raiment\nTo touch --\nYet persevered toward -- sure -- for the Distance --\nHow high --\nUnto the Saint's slow diligence --\nThe Sky --\nUngained -- it may be -- by a Life's low Venture --\nBut then --\nEternity enable the endeavoring\nAgain.",
