      "But a Rope will --",
      "Notwithstanding a Rope for a Souvenir",
      "Is not beautiful --",
      "But I tell you every step is a Trough --",
      "And every stop a Well --",
      "Now will you have the Rope or the Floss?",
      "Prices reasonable --"
