      "A chilly Peace infests the Grass",
      "The Sun respectful lies --",
      "Not any Trance of industry",
      "These shadows scrutinize --",
      "Whose Allies go no more astray",
      "For service or for Glee --",
      "But all mankind deliver here",
      "From whatsoever sea --"
