      "If Mother -- in the Grave --",
      "Or Father -- on the Sea --",
      "Or Father in the Firmament --",
      "Or Brethren, had he --",
      "If Commonwealth below,",
      "Or Commonwealth above",
      "Have missed a Barefoot Citizen --",
      "I've ransomed it -- alive --"
